{
"note_claim": "The extended ISS stay for Sunita Williams and Butch Wilmore was due to helium leaks and problems with the spacecraft's maneuvering thrusters on the Boeing Starliner.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "NASA and Boeing identified helium leaks and experienced issues with the spacecraft reaction control thrusters on June 6 as Starliner approached the space station.",
"reason": "The page explicitly confirms the technical issues (helium leaks and thrusters) that led to the decision to return Starliner uncrewed and extend the astronauts' stay."
}
